Read RULES.txt — 6 gate checks must pass:
1. game_files: ≤993 files, ≤48 MiB total in game/
2. three_js: three.module.min.js + three.core.min.js of 0.187.0 byte-for-byte, import map maps "three" to a path inside game/
3. references: every src/href/import must be relative, resolve inside game/, no network loads
4. screenshots: 3-4 images, ≤256 KiB each, long ≤1280px, short ≥480px
5. dossier_matches: dossier.json byte-for-byte what buildDossier writes
6. js_parses: every .js/.mjs parses as ES module

Plan: use the kit starter as the base (three.js 0.187.0 vendored bytes are correct), replace game/src/* with my full sci-fi tactical FPS implementation, keep main.ts + vendor/makefun-threejs.ts unchanged.

